{"curationManifestSha256":"98e90b3603b34b437bc554810c21f01c4db44d10364211af114d30fde3d67bad","curationVersion":"2026-07-30.2","lessonId":"lesson-1755-p4","main":{"annotations":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"奈何天，令人无可奈何的时光。多表示百无聊赖的思绪。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11211-1"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"谁家，哪一家。一说作“什么”解。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11211-2"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"朝飞暮卷，语出唐王勃《滕王阁》：“画栋朝飞南浦云，珠帘暮卷西山雨。”","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11211-3"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"锦屏人忒看的这韶光贱，意思是，我这深闺女子太辜负这美好春光。锦屏人，深闺中人。忒，过于。看的……贱，把……看轻。韶光，美好的时光，多指春光。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11211-4"}],"blocks":[{"level":2,"runs":[{"text":"游 园","type":"text"}],"type":"heading"},{"runs":[{"text":"汤显祖","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"【皂罗袍】原来姹紫嫣红开遍，似这般都付与断井颓垣。\n\n良辰美景奈何天","type":"text"},{"label":"[1]","noteId":"footnote-11211-1","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，赏心乐事谁家","type":"text"},{"label":"[2]","noteId":"footnote-11211-2","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"院！\n\n朝飞暮卷","type":"text"},{"label":"[3]","noteId":"footnote-11211-3","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，云霞翠轩；雨丝风片，烟波画船——锦屏人忒看的这韶光贱","type":"text"},{"label":"[4]","noteId":"footnote-11211-4","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"！","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"杜丽娘出生于官宦家庭，从小受封建家长的管束和封建礼教的压抑。她受到《诗经·关雎》的触动，青春意识开始觉醒。于是违背父母、塾师训诫，走出深闺，偷偷前往后花园游赏。盛开的百花，绚烂的色彩，开启了她的心扉。这段曲词细腻生动地描摹了一个少女青春萌动时的微妙心理，情真意切。诵读时注意把握主人公的情绪流转，体会作者融情于景的写法。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"frontMatter":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"选自《牡丹亭》（《汤显祖戏曲集》，上海古籍出版社 1978 年版）。题目是编者加的。汤显祖（1550—1616），字义仍，号若士，临川（今江西抚州）人，明代戏曲作家。代表作有传奇《紫钗记》《牡丹亭》《南柯记》《邯郸记》，合称“玉茗堂（汤显祖居所名）四梦”或“临川四梦”。《牡丹亭》全剧共五十五出，描写了南安太守杜宝的女儿杜丽娘与书生柳梦梅的爱情故事。这段曲词出自第十出《惊梦》。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"}],"guidance":[],"links":[],"media":[],"sourceOnlyBlocks":[],"sourcePostId":"11211-4","sourcePostNumber":1},"mediaReceiptLedgerSha256":"5487243dd8d14d65dfadc20ed544a999aaa318fc20c291462ea62c69e1eff320","mediaReceiptLedgerVersion":"2026-07-30.2","provenance":{"links":[{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#p-11211-h-1","postId":"11211-4","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#p-11211-h-1","text":"#p-11211-h-1","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11211-1","postId":"11211-4","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11211-1","text":"[1]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11211-2","postId":"11211-4","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11211-2","text":"[2]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11211-3","postId":"11211-4","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11211-3","text":"[3]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11211-4","postId":"11211-4","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11211-4","text":"[4]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-ref-11211-1","postId":"11211-4","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-ref-11211-1","text":"↩︎","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-ref-11211-2","postId":"11211-4","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-ref-11211-2","text":"↩︎","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-ref-11211-3","postId":"11211-4","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-ref-11211-3","text":"↩︎","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-ref-11211-4","postId":"11211-4","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-ref-11211-4","text":"↩︎","title":null}],"media":[],"posts":[{"cookedSha256":"d6aaecf3e8cd063734598e95b67a4736ec03276b18a08c98a98b1c0cb1dc47cc","createdAt":"2024-08-22T14:46:04Z","plainTextSha256":"28dd9f8ddb8fb81322c53dd2f8edc76cb98ec2311f5760c353ebfb12fbc1cfc6","postId":"11211-4","postNumber":1,"replyToPostNumber":null,"role":"primary","updatedAt":"2024-08-22T14:46:04Z"}],"roleAuditDecisions":[],"sourceLessonPath":"data/lessons/lesson-1755-p4.json","sourceLessonUpdatedAt":"2024-08-22T14:46:04Z","sourcePostCount":1},"resources":[],"roleAuditSha256":"65654ae8bd58de3c8040438da7fc213c00b7175d6dc82802a995f46c4cdfd4a7","roleAuditVersion":"2026-07-30.2","schemaVersion":"yw-reader-document-v1","supplementary":[],"title":"游园（皂罗袍）"}
